<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  SMAppService(ServiceManagement, macOS 13+) LaunchAgent for joule-smcd — the KeepAlive resident
  daemon that keeps publishing live SMC power/temp + per-minute recording even while Joule.app
  itself isn't running (see native/smcd). Bundled at
  Joule.app/Contents/Library/LaunchAgents/ (tauri.conf.json bundle.macOS.files); registering it
  via SMAppService.agent(plistName:) groups its Settings > 백그라운드 앱 활동 row under "Joule"
  instead of the code-signing developer name (same reasoning as kr.kdr.joule.sampler.plist —
  see the BTM 지식노트).

  Static/shipped-identically: no per-user path baked in (no JOULE_DATA env, no
  StandardOut/ErrorPath) — native/smcd's own default (~/Library/Application Support/joule)
  already covers this.

  Do NOT combine ProgramArguments with BundleProgram — launchd rejects the spawn with
  EX_CONFIG (measured 2026-07-22); BundleProgram alone supplies the executable.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key><string>kr.kdr.joule.smcd</string>
  <key>BundleProgram</key><string>Contents/MacOS/joule-smcd</string>
  <key>KeepAlive</key><true/>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key><true/>
</dict>
</plist>
